1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,713
The USS Konrad: a mining freighter drifting in deep space.

2
00:00:03,713 --> 00:00:05,420
Current whereabouts: unknown.

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,389
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,923
Place two Keycard tokens where the Setup card shows.

5
00:00:10,923 --> 00:00:14,379
Start with one Keycard Item in your inventory, with a token on it.

6
00:00:14,379 --> 00:00:18,673
Set two more Keycard cards aside with the spare tokens, and shuffle the last three

7
00:00:18,673 --> 00:00:19,720
into the Item decks.

8
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:23,897
Put the Super Loader card beside the board with its token in the Hangar, and lay out

9
00:00:23,897 --> 00:00:25,593
the three Maintenance cards face up.

10
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,939
Keycards open shafts and run the ship's machinery.

11
00:00:29,159 --> 00:00:33,451
If you start or end your movement on a space with a Keycard token, not just passing

12
00:00:33,451 --> 00:00:37,795
through, you can spend Time to take it. Take one of the set-aside Keycard Item cards

13
00:00:37,795 --> 00:00:39,036
and put the token on it.

14
00:00:39,256 --> 00:00:43,139
Any Keycard card you get by searching or from an event also gets a token.

15
00:00:43,359 --> 00:00:47,574
Using a Keycard means placing its token on the board or a Maintenance card.

16
00:00:47,574 --> 00:00:52,239
That costs no Time. You keep the empty Keycard card, and it can never be discarded:

17
00:00:52,239 --> 00:00:56,791
ignore it for any discard effect. Once placed, tokens stay put unless a card says

18
00:00:56,791 --> 00:00:57,353
otherwise.

19
00:00:58,167 --> 00:01:02,049
There are four Maintenance Shafts on the board, each with an empty Keycard spot

20
00:01:02,049 --> 00:01:02,540
beside it.

21
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:06,067
While a shaft is inactive, neither you nor Victims can pass through it.

22
00:01:06,287 --> 00:01:10,234
When you're next to an inactive shaft, place a Keycard token on it to activate it.

23
00:01:10,234 --> 00:01:13,988
From then on you, and any Victims following you, can travel through it freely.

24
00:01:14,208 --> 00:01:17,506
Enemies can't move through shafts at all, unless a card allows it.

25
00:01:17,506 --> 00:01:19,755
That makes active shafts your safe shortcuts.

26
00:01:20,567 --> 00:01:23,312
Four rooms are highlighted in purple with a gear icon:

27
00:01:23,312 --> 00:01:26,362
the Trash Compactor, the Furnace, the Hangar and the Bridge.

28
00:01:26,362 --> 00:01:29,260
Each runs a ship function shown on the Maintenance cards:

29
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:32,513
the Crusher, the Incinerator, the Airlock and the Self Destruct.

30
00:01:32,733 --> 00:01:35,568
To use one, you must be in that room, not passing through.

31
00:01:35,568 --> 00:01:38,402
Place Keycard tokens in the slots on its Maintenance card.

32
00:01:38,402 --> 00:01:41,285
Each function needs a different number, shown by the slots.

33
00:01:41,285 --> 00:01:43,827
When it's full, follow that function's instructions.

34
00:01:44,047 --> 00:01:48,452
If any effect later removes Keycard tokens from a function you've already activated,

35
00:01:48,452 --> 00:01:51,599
it's cancelled immediately, along with any tokens it placed.

36
00:01:52,433 --> 00:01:55,267
The Self Destruct takes four Keycards at the Bridge.

37
00:01:55,267 --> 00:01:59,408
Once activated, put the radiation token at the start of the Countdown track.

38
00:01:59,408 --> 00:02:01,479
Every Upkeep, move it one space right.

39
00:02:01,699 --> 00:02:05,106
When it reaches the explosion, the ship blows up, killing everything.

40
00:02:05,106 --> 00:02:07,821
If you're not standing at an Escape Pod exit, you lose.

41
00:02:08,041 --> 00:02:11,578
The Airlock and the Self Destruct can both kill you along with the Killer.

42
00:02:11,578 --> 00:02:14,399
If that happens, you lose, even though the Killer died too.

43
00:02:15,233 --> 00:02:19,660
The Super Loader exo-suit starts in the Hangar, but you can only use it once you've

44
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:24,140
found the Super Loader Key item. Then, in its space, take and equip the Super Loader

45
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:24,407
card.

46
00:02:24,627 --> 00:02:28,914
While equipped, Victims won't follow you, all your movement is reduced by one, all

47
00:02:28,914 --> 00:02:33,044
damage you take is reduced by one, both to a minimum of one, and you can't play

48
00:02:33,044 --> 00:02:34,717
Short Rest, Long Rest or Search.

49
00:02:34,937 --> 00:02:39,082
If you unequip it or lose the Key, leave the token in your space and return the card

50
00:02:39,082 --> 00:02:41,401
beside the board. It can't go in your backpack.

51
00:02:42,233 --> 00:02:46,797
Watch for a few ship cards. Catastrophic Hull Breach puts a Skull token on the exit

52
00:02:46,797 --> 00:02:51,360
farthest from you. Anyone who is in or enters that space dies instantly, the Killer

53
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:51,855
included.

54
00:02:52,075 --> 00:02:56,262
Gas Leak and Faulty Wiring make you roll for damage near the shafts, the Furnace and

55
00:02:56,262 --> 00:02:57,259
the Trash Compactor.

56
00:02:57,479 --> 00:03:01,717
System Reboot returns every placed Keycard to its card, cancelling activated

57
00:03:01,717 --> 00:03:06,012
functions. And the Slippery Minor Dark Power lets the Killer use every shaft.

58
00:03:06,833 --> 00:03:11,013
A few tips. Keycards are scarce, so decide early whether you want shafts, a ship

59
00:03:11,013 --> 00:03:11,953
function, or both.

60
00:03:12,173 --> 00:03:15,971
Enemies can't follow you through an active shaft, so it's a great escape route.

61
00:03:16,191 --> 00:03:20,456
Only trigger the Self Destruct when you can reach an Escape Pod before the countdown

62
00:03:20,456 --> 00:03:21,268
ends. Good luck.

